<title>USA: TABLE - Boyd Gaming sells $250 mln 144a notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Boyd Gaming sells $250 mln 144a notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Boyd Gaming Corp was priced Thursday via lead manager Salomon Brothers Inc, according to a market source.</p>
<p>Boyd Gaming owns and operates casino entertainment properties in Nevada, Mississippi, Illinois, Louisiana and Missouri.</p>
<p>BORROWER BOYD GAMING CORP</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 9.50 PCT   MATURITY 7/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 98.90   FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD 9.675 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-MINUS  SPREAD +350 BPS   CALLABLE  NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
